// EON unified theme band — published by Swing_Kit_Bridge from rk_lua_theme
// (mirrors rk_lua_core GMEM.GS_THEME_*). gmem[GS_THEME_ID] is the generation
// handshake: 0 = nothing published → keep the hardcoded iMPC colours. Else 8
