  // per instance (perf sweep 2026-08-06; the duplicate predated the header
  // being extracted into its own function).

  // ── Re-dock hello ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // A Swing the user docked from the wordmark, then closed, comes back as a
  // plain float: the pane script exits when its tab closes and clears slider42
