  // the SWING wordmark, swing_ui_viewmode_click) pins a face outright; only
  // Auto consults the geometry.
  // The small-things round (2026-10-23) splits the answer in two: this block's
  // result is dock_face_user, the face the user's pick or Auto chose; the face
  // DRAWN is dock_face, which also turns to the rack face while a panel under
  // the pads leaves the full face too little room (swing_face_room, below).
  // The bottom slot's own gate (rk_seq_ui swing_seq_gate) and the pad panel's
