  // (user 2026-09-23: "the strip everywhere"): the grid-rect views leave its band free above their panel, the two
  // full-window views (console, FX picker) start under it. The rack / dock face draws it over the pad grid only
  // (swing_banktabs_shown; spec 8.1 left it out until the user's 2026-10-15 report). Under the pad editor it was
